OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir levels fall despite
OL,4,Awettest day in months
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecent rainfall has provided a boost
OL,7,Ffor Guernsey's reservoirs but water
OL,8,Freserves are still falling and
OL,9,Fislanders are being urged to keep
OL,10,Fcutting back on their water use.
OL,12,FGuernsey Water said 6mm of rain fell on
OL,13,F19 August, making it the wettest day
OL,14,Fsince 1 June and more rainfall than was
OL,15,Frecorded during the whole of July.
OL,17,FThe rain slowed the decline in
OL,18,Freservoir levels but did not reverse
OL,19,Fthe overall trend.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
