OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir levels fall despite
OL,4,Awettest day in months
OL,5,
OL,6,FReservoirs were now 74.4% full, with
OL,7,Fstorage levels around 10% below the
OL,8,Fseasonal average. Guernsey Water said
OL,9,Fthat equated to about 400 million
OL,10,Flitres of water, or about a month's
OL,11,Fworth of summer demand.
